WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.875
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.145 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:35.185 --> 01:39.025
ADAPTED FROM JIA JIN CHAI, ORIGINAL NOVEL BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

4
02:00.185 --> 02:01.745
Greetings, Noble Lady Wu'an.

5
02:02.825 --> 02:05.345
Lord Lu came about an old case

6
02:05.425 --> 02:06.665
and visited the Court of Justice late at night.

7
02:07.345 --> 02:10.105
I made an exception and pulled the case files from 16 years ago.

8
02:13.425 --> 02:14.265
What case?

9
02:15.225 --> 02:17.025
Sixteen years ago, during the Lantern Festival,

10
02:17.625 --> 02:19.425
the young daughter of the Earl of Cheng'an's second branch,

11
02:20.025 --> 02:22.665
Wei Rao, was kidnapped and trafficked.

12
02:23.905 --> 02:27.025
Afterward, her wet nurse and guards fled in fear of punishment.

13
02:27.625 --> 02:29.865
On their way to South Mountain, bandits killed them.

14
02:30.385 --> 02:31.665
His Majesty was furious.

15
02:31.745 --> 02:33.705
He ordered the Court of Justice to handle the case.

16
02:34.305 --> 02:35.585
He also sent troops to search the entire city,

17
02:36.225 --> 02:37.505
but there was no news.

18
02:37.585 --> 02:38.825
Not until May the following year,

19
02:38.905 --> 02:40.265
when the Wei family

20
02:40.945 --> 02:42.785
found the girl at a market after she'd been missing for a year.

21
02:46.065 --> 02:47.545
What was she wearing

22
02:48.545 --> 02:49.825
the day she was kidnapped?

23
02:50.345 --> 02:51.745
At the time,

24
02:51.825 --> 02:54.025
Lady Wei Rao was barely two.

25
02:54.105 --> 02:56.785
She wore a crimson brocade robe with cloud patterns,

26
02:57.345 --> 03:01.025
a white fox cloak, and little white silk socks,

27
03:01.105 --> 03:02.905
with red silk shoes with upturned toes.

28
03:02.985 --> 03:06.185
She wore a gold-and-jade Longevity Lock,

29
03:06.265 --> 03:07.945
engraved with "Long Life"

30
03:08.025 --> 03:09.985
and "Endless Blessings".

31
03:10.065 --> 03:11.105
LONG LIFE, ENDLESS BLESSINGS

32
03:15.945 --> 03:17.665
This is the one.

33
03:18.625 --> 03:20.905
Then who is the Lady Wei Rao at Xianzhuang?

34
03:22.385 --> 03:24.425
How could something so bizarre and horrifying happen?

35
03:40.545 --> 03:42.945
Who are you? Why are you sneaking around out there?

36
03:43.025 --> 03:45.225
Spare me, My Lord. Your Ladyship.

37
03:45.825 --> 03:48.305
I thought this courtyard was abandoned,

38
03:48.385 --> 03:50.265
so I came looking for valuables.

39
03:50.865 --> 03:52.025
So you're a thief!

40
03:52.865 --> 03:54.585
You recognized him as Lord Lu at once,

41
03:54.665 --> 03:55.865
and I as Noble Lady Wu'an.

42
03:56.545 --> 03:58.185
You're clearly no common thief.

43
03:58.265 --> 03:59.705
Much appreciated, sir.

44
03:59.785 --> 04:00.985
Please take him back to the Court of Justice

45
04:01.065 --> 04:02.385
and question him thoroughly.

46
04:02.465 --> 04:03.945
No need to ask, Your Ladyship.

47
04:04.025 --> 04:05.225
The Court of Justice

48
04:05.305 --> 04:07.345
has plenty of ways to deal with petty thieves.

49
04:07.985 --> 04:09.825
Your Ladyship, forgive me! Please!

50
04:10.505 --> 04:12.905
I lied! I'm not a thief!

51
04:12.985 --> 04:14.745
I-I-I'm…

52
04:19.305 --> 04:20.705
Escort the Deputy Justice out.

53
04:21.305 --> 04:23.385
Everyone else, wait outside the courtyard.

54
04:24.105 --> 04:24.945
Yes.

55
04:40.985 --> 04:43.825
Your Ladyship, my name is Lv Lun.

56
04:43.905 --> 04:45.825
I'm a steward at the Earl of Cheng'an's estate.

57
04:45.905 --> 04:49.265
My wife is surnamed Chang. She once served Lady Guo.

58
04:49.345 --> 04:51.625
Three days ago, my wife fled the residence,

59
04:51.705 --> 04:54.545
but someone murdered her.

60
04:54.625 --> 04:55.825
Who killed her?

61
04:55.905 --> 04:58.785
The fake Lady Wei Rao at Xianzhuang!

62
05:02.625 --> 05:03.865
How do you know she's an impostor?

63
05:03.945 --> 05:07.425
My wife discovered the truth about her identity,

64
05:07.505 --> 05:08.825
and was killed and silenced.

65
05:09.625 --> 05:13.145
I also know what really happened back then.

66
05:13.225 --> 05:15.185
Rather than live in fear every night,

67
05:15.265 --> 05:16.745
waiting to be murdered,

68
05:16.825 --> 05:19.505
I chose to risk coming to you, Your Ladyship.

69
05:19.585 --> 05:21.745
I only hope this can atone for my crimes

70
05:21.825 --> 05:23.665
and spare my life, Your Ladyship!

71
05:24.305 --> 05:26.065
Tell me everything you know.

72
05:26.145 --> 05:27.545
Leave nothing out.

73
05:27.625 --> 05:29.385
If you lie about a single word,

74
05:30.025 --> 05:31.465
I'll break every bone in your body, one by one!

75
05:32.265 --> 05:35.665
I wouldn't dare! Every word I say is true.

76
05:35.745 --> 05:37.105
It was Wei Heng'e.

77
05:37.185 --> 05:38.705
She hated Second Madam Zhou…

78
05:38.785 --> 05:42.465
No. She hated Lady Li for abandoning her daughter and remarrying.

79
05:42.545 --> 05:44.825
She bribed the wet nurse and guards

80
05:44.905 --> 05:46.785
to deliberately abandon Lady Wei Rao.

81
05:46.865 --> 05:49.345
My wife saw it all herself.

82
05:49.425 --> 05:50.745
Over a year later,

83
05:50.825 --> 05:52.505
Lady Li couldn't bear losing her daughter.

84
05:52.585 --> 05:54.025
She kept searching everywhere.

85
05:54.105 --> 05:56.865
To keep His Majesty from blaming the Earl of Cheng'an's family,

86
05:56.945 --> 05:58.345
Wei Heng'e came up with another vicious plan.

87
05:58.425 --> 06:00.665
She found a girl of similar age and appearance

88
06:00.745 --> 06:03.145
to take Lady Wei Rao's place.

89
06:03.225 --> 06:05.785
Your Ladyship, I can testify

90
06:05.865 --> 06:07.585
that the Wei Rao at Xianzhuang is an impostor.

91
06:07.665 --> 06:09.265
You, Your Ladyship,

92
06:09.345 --> 06:12.425
are the true daughter of the Earl's family.

93
06:17.745 --> 06:19.225
We have both witnesses and evidence.

94
06:21.065 --> 06:22.385
What's on your mind?

95
06:23.865 --> 06:24.705
No.

96
06:26.905 --> 06:28.345
No, something's wrong.

97
06:29.585 --> 06:32.425
There are still too many things that don't add up.

98
06:34.865 --> 06:38.185
Finding two young girls who look nearly identical

99
06:38.265 --> 06:40.305
and are about the same age is hard enough.

100
06:41.985 --> 06:43.505
Yet all these years,

101
06:44.345 --> 06:47.345
Wei Heng'e has treasured her brother's only daughter.

102
06:47.945 --> 06:49.705
For this fake Wei Rao,

103
06:50.385 --> 06:51.385
she even found a substitute bride.

104
06:52.305 --> 06:53.825
That makes no sense at all.

105
06:54.905 --> 06:56.345
Jundai and I

106
06:57.305 --> 06:58.705
do look very much alike.

107
07:00.385 --> 07:01.945
Wei Heng'e and your birth father…

108
07:04.225 --> 07:05.505
were twins.

109
07:08.665 --> 07:10.505
-Jundai is her daughter. -Jundai is her daughter.

110
07:15.785 --> 07:17.345
I'm going to the Earl of Cheng'an's Residence.

111
07:18.025 --> 07:19.505
I need to see Old Madam Wei.

112
07:20.385 --> 07:21.505
Right now.

113
07:22.585 --> 07:24.065
I know how to handle this.

114
07:24.145 --> 07:25.625
You should return to camp, My Lord.

115
07:25.705 --> 07:28.505
Don't let me delay matters of state.

116
07:32.105 --> 07:32.945
Zhao Song.

117
07:33.545 --> 07:36.065
Go with her to the Wei Residence. Take more men with you.

118
07:36.705 --> 07:38.345
-Yes, My Lord. -Zhao Bai.

119
07:38.865 --> 07:40.625
Pick 200 elite soldiers from the camp.

120
07:41.225 --> 07:42.985
-I have another use for them. -Yes.

121
07:45.025 --> 07:47.425
-My Lord, that maid Bitao… -Tell me on the way.

122
07:56.105 --> 07:57.225
Lady Li,

123
07:57.305 --> 07:59.505
the men sent to fetch Madam Qiao are back.

124
07:59.585 --> 08:01.665
They were ambushed on the way.

125
08:01.745 --> 08:04.665
Madam Qiao and the other two are missing.

126
08:09.025 --> 08:11.065
Who else would dare

127
08:11.145 --> 08:12.705
abduct them in broad daylight but her?

128
08:13.465 --> 08:16.665
So young, yet so brazen!

129
08:16.745 --> 08:18.825
Has the Empress Dowager's procession left the palace?

130
08:18.905 --> 08:21.265
Don't worry, Lady Li. Aman went to check.

131
08:23.985 --> 08:24.825
Lady Li,

132
08:24.905 --> 08:26.785
the Empress Dowager's royal carriage is already 20 miles outside the city.

133
08:26.865 --> 08:28.865
The Empress and the other consorts went with her.

134
08:29.865 --> 08:30.785
Good.

135
08:31.745 --> 08:33.505
All that patience wasn't for nothing.

136
08:33.585 --> 08:35.144
I've finally lived to see this day.

137
08:35.784 --> 08:38.865
The Empress Dowager has gone to the hot springs for treatment.

138
08:39.664 --> 08:42.385
Now I can cut out this rot without holding back.

139
08:43.185 --> 08:44.985
By the time she returns to the capital,

140
08:45.065 --> 08:46.985
it'll all be over.

141
08:47.745 --> 08:50.425
Prepare the carriage. I'm leaving the palace.

142
08:52.345 --> 08:53.225
-Yes. -Yes, Your Ladyship.

143
09:04.945 --> 09:07.225
EARL OF CHENG'AN'S RESIDENCE

144
09:08.945 --> 09:12.265
Those two pretty girls were just playthings to pass the time.

145
09:12.785 --> 09:14.465
Not worth upsetting Mother this much.

146
09:15.705 --> 09:17.465
I've already moved them out of the residence.

147
09:17.545 --> 09:19.145
They're fragile ladies.

148
09:20.065 --> 09:21.185
Weak and delicate.

149
09:22.025 --> 09:24.385
Losing support all at once,

150
09:24.465 --> 09:27.025
they are bound to struggle to get by.

151
09:27.945 --> 09:29.305
I understand.

152
09:29.385 --> 09:30.225
GRACE OF AUTUMN, HEART OF VIRTUE

153
09:30.305 --> 09:32.585
As for their expenses,

154
09:32.665 --> 09:34.145
I'll find an excuse

155
09:35.225 --> 09:37.305
to pay them from the household account.

156
09:39.985 --> 09:43.705
With a wife like you, what more could I ask for?

157
09:43.785 --> 09:45.185
It's simply my duty.

158
09:46.825 --> 09:47.665
Oh, right.

159
09:48.265 --> 09:51.385
Lady Chun had abdominal pain for half the night last night.

160
09:51.465 --> 09:54.585
We called a physician, but he couldn't find the cause.

161
09:56.065 --> 09:57.225
You should go check on her.

162
09:58.745 --> 10:00.425
She's always throwing tantrums.

163
10:01.625 --> 10:04.825
If everyone were as sensible and understanding as you,

164
10:04.905 --> 10:06.705
I'd have far fewer headaches.

165
10:07.825 --> 10:09.505
Farewell, My Lord.

166
10:11.345 --> 10:12.905
I'll go see her.

167
10:16.785 --> 10:17.625
My back…

168
10:18.265 --> 10:19.745
This is really getting in the way.

169
10:22.225 --> 10:23.265
Brother.

170
10:23.345 --> 10:25.665
Can't you see your brother can barely move?

171
10:26.265 --> 10:28.665
You're a grown woman. How can you still be so reckless and rude?

172
10:29.265 --> 10:30.225
Rude.

173
10:35.905 --> 10:38.985
Yufeng, save me! Yufeng, please save me!

174
10:39.705 --> 10:41.985
Get up first. Come on.

175
10:47.345 --> 10:48.225
You may leave.

176
10:48.305 --> 10:49.425
Yes.

177
10:53.665 --> 10:57.025
Yufeng, I just saw Noble Lady Wu'an.

178
10:57.105 --> 10:58.665
She brought a man here under guard.

179
10:58.745 --> 10:59.905
I sent men to find out why.

180
10:59.985 --> 11:01.985
She actually has a witness and evidence

181
11:02.065 --> 11:04.385
proving she's the real Wei Rao.

182
11:04.465 --> 11:06.545
I'd had my suspicions before.

183
11:06.625 --> 11:07.945
After all, she looks…

184
11:08.025 --> 11:10.145
But strange things happen in this world.

185
11:10.225 --> 11:12.225
Two people looking alike isn't that unusual.

186
11:12.985 --> 11:14.345
Besides, back then,

187
11:14.865 --> 11:17.705
that child was clearly dead.

188
11:18.585 --> 11:19.945
She's dead!

189
11:20.025 --> 11:21.985
We all saw it with our own eyes.

190
11:23.465 --> 11:26.065
Could it be

191
11:26.145 --> 11:28.385
that the dead really can come back to life?

192
11:29.585 --> 11:32.825
Yufeng… She's really back.

193
11:32.905 --> 11:35.225
She's come back! You have to help me.

194
11:35.305 --> 11:37.665
If you refuse to save me now,

195
11:37.745 --> 11:40.665
a truly catastrophic disaster awaits us!

196
11:42.865 --> 11:45.665
There's always a way out. Don't panic.

197
11:47.385 --> 11:48.265
But she…

198
11:49.625 --> 11:52.345
Zhou Fu and I were sisters-in-law for years.

199
11:52.425 --> 11:54.185
I know her better than anyone.

200
11:54.265 --> 11:56.465
She's clever.

201
11:57.185 --> 11:59.665
Too clever for her own good.

202
12:00.265 --> 12:02.105
People who are proud

203
12:02.705 --> 12:04.665
and strong-willed

204
12:05.185 --> 12:09.705
are often stubborn and determined to have their own way.

205
12:10.345 --> 12:12.225
All these years in the palace,

206
12:12.305 --> 12:16.345
she's lived in luxury, above everyone else.

207
12:16.425 --> 12:18.705
Now she can't stand anyone defying her.

208
12:18.785 --> 12:20.665
‎GRACE OF AUTUMN, HEART OF VIRTUE

209
12:20.745 --> 12:24.105
Use that weakness to your advantage.

210
12:26.345 --> 12:27.745
It's just…

211
12:27.825 --> 12:30.345
Yufeng, you have another way?

212
12:31.065 --> 12:32.985
It's a vicious plan.

213
12:33.065 --> 12:34.785
It may bring bad karma.

214
12:34.865 --> 12:36.705
Forget it. Pretend I said nothing.

215
12:36.785 --> 12:37.625
Hey…

216
12:38.145 --> 12:40.545
Yufeng, I'll do whatever you say.

217
12:40.625 --> 12:42.665
As long as you can save me,

218
12:42.745 --> 12:44.105
I'll give you anything you want.

219
12:44.785 --> 12:47.665
-Yufeng… -No. We really can't.

220
12:47.745 --> 12:49.825
Yufeng, we're out of time!

221
12:50.625 --> 12:52.265
Just tell me what to do.

222
12:52.865 --> 12:54.665
Works or not, I'll take full responsibility.

223
12:54.745 --> 12:56.785
I won't drag you into this.

224
12:56.865 --> 12:59.185
And for the rest of my life,

225
12:59.265 --> 13:01.665
I'll never forget what you've done for me.

226
13:05.465 --> 13:07.145
Since it's come to this,

227
13:08.105 --> 13:09.545
we might as well try.

228
13:10.425 --> 13:12.825
Whether it works is up to fate.

229
13:55.665 --> 13:56.505
Who's there?

230
13:56.585 --> 13:58.265
It's me, Grandmother.

231
14:02.345 --> 14:04.145
You're sick too.

232
14:04.225 --> 14:07.425
Didn't the physician tell you to get plenty of rest?

233
14:08.465 --> 14:10.545
I don't need you tending to me.

234
14:10.625 --> 14:12.345
Go back and rest.

235
14:12.425 --> 14:14.145
I've been confined to the Wei family since childhood,

236
14:14.225 --> 14:15.945
so I never had the chance to be close to you.

237
14:16.025 --> 14:17.545
Now that I finally have this chance,

238
14:17.625 --> 14:20.225
I only wish to stay by your side every day.

239
14:20.305 --> 14:23.025
How could caring for you ever be a burden?

240
14:26.065 --> 14:27.505
Grandmother, you don't look well.

241
14:30.985 --> 14:33.265
At my age…

242
14:34.145 --> 14:36.185
A few aches and fevers are inevitable.

243
14:36.265 --> 14:40.305
But today, for some reason, I feel especially drowsy.

244
14:41.025 --> 14:43.105
I have no strength at all.

245
14:46.905 --> 14:50.185
Perhaps you've caught a chill. We shouldn't take it lightly.

246
14:50.705 --> 14:53.385
Lie down and rest, Grandmother. I'll fetch the physician.

247
14:53.985 --> 14:54.945
All right.

248
15:03.545 --> 15:04.865
Take good care of her.

249
15:05.505 --> 15:06.465
-Yes. -Yes.

250
15:20.825 --> 15:21.825
Go tell Grandmother I'm here.

251
15:21.905 --> 15:22.905
I have matters to discuss.

252
15:22.985 --> 15:24.905
Young Master, Old Madam has taken a chill.

253
15:24.985 --> 15:26.585
She suffers from headache and fever, and has remained in a deep sleep.

254
15:27.185 --> 15:28.465
I didn't dare disturb her.

255
15:29.385 --> 15:30.705
That's strange.

256
15:30.785 --> 15:31.945
She's always been in excellent health.

257
15:32.545 --> 15:34.825
She climbed the whole mountain at Double Ninth without stopping.

258
15:34.905 --> 15:36.545
How did she suddenly fall ill?

259
15:38.025 --> 15:38.865
Has a physician seen her?

260
15:39.465 --> 15:40.705
The physician took her pulse.

261
15:40.785 --> 15:43.185
He said a chill had weakened her vital energy.

262
15:43.265 --> 15:45.105
He prescribed Cinnamon Twig Decoction to dispel the chill.

263
15:46.865 --> 15:47.865
Then I'll come back later.

264
15:52.265 --> 15:53.105
Has Wei Rao been here?

265
15:53.745 --> 15:54.705
Yes, Young Master.

266
15:54.785 --> 15:57.025
Physician Wang first wanted to prescribe Ephedra Decoction.

267
15:57.105 --> 15:58.585
Young Lady called him an incompetent old fool.

268
15:58.665 --> 16:00.545
She said sweating is in need of Cinnamon Twig Decoction.

269
16:00.625 --> 16:03.025
Then Physicians Li and Zhang confirmed the diagnosis

270
16:03.105 --> 16:04.745
before Old Madam took the medicine.

271
16:04.825 --> 16:07.665
Young Lady stayed with Old Madam until she'd taken her medicine.

272
16:08.705 --> 16:09.665
She's certainly attentive.

273
16:10.825 --> 16:13.105
-Tell me as soon as Grandmother wakes. -Yes.

274
16:13.185 --> 16:17.425
HERON LODGE

275
16:18.105 --> 16:21.865
Aunt Heng'e, I've cleared every obstacle from your path.

276
16:21.945 --> 16:24.105
Don't disappoint me.

277
16:31.745 --> 16:35.145
Lu Zhuo. I won't let you ruin my plans again today.

278
16:36.145 --> 16:38.905
It's time to end this once and for all.

279
16:39.505 --> 16:41.545
Wait!

280
16:42.145 --> 16:44.545
Lady Li!

281
16:44.625 --> 16:47.145
Make way for Lady Li! Anyone blocking her procession gets 100 lashes!

282
16:47.225 --> 16:48.345
Lower your head!

283
16:48.425 --> 16:49.505
Lady Li.

284
16:49.585 --> 16:51.985
Someone from the Earl of Cheng'an's family seeks an audience.

285
16:52.065 --> 16:54.945
Lady Li! I have something urgent to report.

286
16:55.025 --> 16:57.665
I'm from the Wei family. I'm Wei Heng'e!

287
16:58.545 --> 17:00.185
So it really is an old acquaintance.

288
17:01.185 --> 17:02.425
It's been 16 years.

289
17:03.025 --> 17:04.905
It truly has been a long time.

290
17:05.665 --> 17:06.545
Let her through.

291
17:11.625 --> 17:14.825
Wei Heng'e greets Lady Li.

292
17:14.905 --> 17:16.065
Wei Heng'e.

293
17:16.825 --> 17:20.184
I remember how you always had a rule for everything.

294
17:20.825 --> 17:23.305
If a widowed sister-in-law grieved too deeply,

295
17:23.825 --> 17:26.585
she was inconsiderate to her elders and called unfilial.

296
17:27.785 --> 17:31.025
If she'd cried herself dry and had no tears left,

297
17:31.105 --> 17:32.785
she was called heartless.

298
17:33.505 --> 17:35.145
If she consulted a male physician,

299
17:35.865 --> 17:38.585
you'd gossip behind her back

300
17:38.665 --> 17:40.905
and call her shameless.

301
17:41.585 --> 17:43.825
Clearly, you hold proper conduct above all else.

302
17:43.905 --> 17:46.185
Then you should know

303
17:46.265 --> 17:48.625
the Imperial Family has its dignity.

304
17:48.705 --> 17:50.945
Anyone who disrupts a royal procession

305
17:51.665 --> 17:53.585
cannot be easily pardoned.

306
17:56.585 --> 17:58.265
Now I'd like to know

307
17:58.905 --> 18:00.785
what could be so important

308
18:01.385 --> 18:03.945
that you had to barge into my procession.

309
18:05.025 --> 18:07.985
If your reason isn't good enough, you'll get 100 lashes.

310
18:08.785 --> 18:10.065
There's no getting out of that.

311
18:11.025 --> 18:12.305
Everything I did before

312
18:12.825 --> 18:14.705
was because I was blind and foolish.

313
18:15.225 --> 18:16.545
I offended you, Lady Li.

314
18:17.465 --> 18:19.065
I'll gladly take the lashes.

315
18:19.705 --> 18:21.865
I only ask for your mercy.

316
18:21.945 --> 18:24.825
But this concerns Noble Lady Wu'an.

317
18:25.465 --> 18:27.545
It concerns your own daughter.

318
18:27.625 --> 18:28.905
Please hear me out.

319
18:28.985 --> 18:32.625
For my late brother's sake,

320
18:32.705 --> 18:34.345
please grant me this favor.

321
18:44.425 --> 18:45.585
Let the Wei family come along.

322
18:48.745 --> 18:51.265
South Mountain isn't far from the capital.

323
18:52.385 --> 18:54.705
This close to the Emperor, it should be peaceful.

324
18:55.225 --> 18:58.585
So why can't these few bandits be wiped out?

325
18:59.665 --> 19:03.265
The bandits of South Mountain have long plagued the court.

326
19:03.345 --> 19:05.145
His Majesty has sent troops there many times,

327
19:05.225 --> 19:06.945
but the more we kill, the more appear.

328
19:07.025 --> 19:09.145
Traveling merchants are terrified of them.

329
19:09.665 --> 19:10.785
Here.

330
19:10.865 --> 19:12.105
The terrain there is treacherous.

331
19:12.185 --> 19:13.905
Easy to defend, hard to attack.

332
19:13.985 --> 19:15.425
The bandits are scattered across the peaks.

333
19:15.505 --> 19:17.425
They hide by day and strike at night.

334
19:17.505 --> 19:18.905
When troops climb the mountain, they flee.

335
19:18.985 --> 19:20.905
We can barely find them, much less wipe them out.

336
19:22.065 --> 19:23.785
But that's the Northern Army's problem.

337
19:23.865 --> 19:25.705
What does it have to do with you, Lord Lu?

338
19:25.785 --> 19:27.345
Why the sudden interest?

339
19:30.265 --> 19:31.865
My Lord, the troops are assembled.

340
19:31.945 --> 19:33.105
We're ready to set out.

341
19:33.745 --> 19:34.905
My Lord.

342
19:36.625 --> 19:38.225
My Lord, word just came from the palace.

343
19:38.305 --> 19:39.905
His Majesty is coming to inspect the troops today.

344
19:39.985 --> 19:42.145
The Imperial procession has already left Sima Gate.

345
19:44.025 --> 19:46.025
Put the entire army on high alert!

346
19:46.105 --> 19:47.545
Assemble all the generals.

347
19:47.625 --> 19:49.305
Come with me to prepare the drill grounds at once!

348
19:52.425 --> 19:54.345
-No. Something's wrong. -What is it?

349
19:54.945 --> 19:56.665
The grand review isn't due yet.

350
19:56.745 --> 19:58.025
the troops are caught unprepared.

351
19:58.545 --> 20:00.745
Inspecting troops in peacetime breaks protocol.

352
20:01.345 --> 20:03.105
Why did His Majesty suddenly change his mind?

353
20:03.745 --> 20:06.185
Something about this doesn't feel right.

354
20:06.825 --> 20:08.425
It is strange.

355
20:08.945 --> 20:10.465
But if His Majesty just got a whim,

356
20:10.545 --> 20:11.745
we just receive him.

357
20:11.825 --> 20:13.145
Don't overthink it.

358
20:13.225 --> 20:15.585
His Majesty moved the inspection up.

359
20:16.105 --> 20:17.425
Someone may have put him up to it.

360
20:18.985 --> 20:20.345
I have something urgent to handle.

361
20:20.865 --> 20:23.545
Shunqin. I'm leaving the camp to you.

362
20:24.465 --> 20:26.385
Find a way to stall the Imperial carriage.

363
20:29.425 --> 20:30.425
Hey you…

364
20:35.025 --> 20:36.425
Where are you going at a time like this?

365
20:36.505 --> 20:38.025
What am I supposed to tell His Majesty?

366
20:38.105 --> 20:40.785
Even His Majesty can't break protocol.

367
20:40.865 --> 20:42.945
Just say the camp's defenses aren't ready

368
20:43.025 --> 20:43.865
and His Majesty's safety could be at risk.

369
20:43.945 --> 20:46.825
Remember, get several censors to join you

370
20:46.905 --> 20:47.745
and do everything you can to stop him.

371
20:47.825 --> 20:49.265
Are you out of your mind?

372
20:49.785 --> 20:51.465
What could matter more than your life?

373
20:52.225 --> 20:54.025
You can't just halt His Majesty's procession.

374
20:54.105 --> 20:56.385
No. You're not going anywhere.

375
20:56.465 --> 20:57.745
Whatever it is, it can wait.

376
20:58.425 --> 21:00.425
You're coming with me to receive His Majesty!

377
21:00.505 --> 21:03.145
General Qi is right. Please think this through, My Lord.

378
21:04.545 --> 21:06.785
I'm counting on you. Move out!

379
21:12.705 --> 21:14.945
ZHAO

380
21:15.585 --> 21:18.065
That fool. That absolute fool!

381
21:19.105 --> 21:20.505
I haven't even told him about Bitao yet.

382
21:20.585 --> 21:22.065
What happened to Bitao?

383
21:22.145 --> 21:24.425
N-Nothing.

384
21:24.505 --> 21:25.745
Maybe I'm just overthinking it.

385
21:26.625 --> 21:28.625
Who knows when His Lordship will be back?

386
21:31.985 --> 21:33.425
SOUTH MOUNTAIN BANDIT STRONGHOLD

387
21:33.505 --> 21:34.865
Top it up.

388
21:35.585 --> 21:36.785
Drink up.

389
21:37.385 --> 21:40.425
The soldiers are coming! The soldiers!

390
21:40.505 --> 21:41.985
Soldiers!

391
21:42.065 --> 21:43.745
The soldiers are coming!

392
21:43.825 --> 21:45.385
The soldiers are coming!

393
21:56.945 --> 21:57.785
Move!

394
22:00.105 --> 22:01.465
-Move! -Hurry!

395
22:04.905 --> 22:05.785
Look closely.

396
22:06.745 --> 22:08.345
Do you recognize these two?

397
22:09.465 --> 22:12.505
No. No… I don't know them…

398
22:12.585 --> 22:13.425
Kill him.

399
22:14.665 --> 22:16.905
No! Wait! Wait! Spare me, General!

400
22:16.985 --> 22:18.785
I've truly never seen them!

401
22:19.425 --> 22:21.985
On South Mountain alone, there are thirteen major strongholds.

402
22:22.065 --> 22:24.625
Their leaders are all ruthless killers.

403
22:24.705 --> 22:26.625
General, perhaps you've got the wrong place.

404
22:27.305 --> 22:28.425
Thirteen?

405
22:29.345 --> 22:30.785
That's no problem.

406
22:31.585 --> 22:32.865
We'll wipe them out one by one.

407
22:32.945 --> 22:36.625
We'll leave heads rolling and the mountains red with blood.

408
22:36.705 --> 22:39.305
Before dawn tomorrow, we'll find them.

409
22:40.385 --> 22:41.425
No, no, wait!

410
22:42.345 --> 22:44.265
I'll do whatever you ask, General!

411
22:44.345 --> 22:46.305
My patience is running thin.

412
22:47.025 --> 22:48.905
You'll lead the way and get us through their gates.

413
22:49.505 --> 22:50.625
Before sunset,

414
22:51.465 --> 22:54.625
I want all thirteen heads. Lined up neatly! Not one missing.

415
22:54.705 --> 22:56.265
At your command, General.

416
22:59.825 --> 23:00.865
XIANZHUANG

417
23:00.945 --> 23:02.625
Everything you just said

418
23:02.705 --> 23:04.305
is true?

419
23:04.385 --> 23:05.985
She harbored a runaway servant from the Wei family

420
23:06.065 --> 23:08.465
and dug into Rao's disappearance from years ago.

421
23:08.545 --> 23:10.345
Who knows what she's really plotting?

422
23:11.145 --> 23:13.425
Heaven and earth are my witnesses.

423
23:13.505 --> 23:15.865
I swear on my late brother.

424
23:15.945 --> 23:17.105
If a single word is false,

425
23:17.185 --> 23:20.305
may I meet a terrible end.

426
23:22.785 --> 23:24.345
This concerns Lady Li's beloved daughter.

427
23:24.425 --> 23:25.745
I dared not hide it from you.

428
23:26.265 --> 23:28.865
For the sake of your own flesh and blood,

429
23:29.545 --> 23:32.505
please judge this fairly and give Rao justice.

430
23:35.025 --> 23:35.985
Lady Li.

431
23:36.065 --> 23:38.385
Old Madam Wei, Lady Guo,

432
23:38.465 --> 23:39.985
and Noble Lady Wu'an request an audience.

433
23:41.785 --> 23:42.705
Very well.

434
23:43.425 --> 23:45.025
Everyone who should be here is here.

435
23:45.625 --> 23:46.705
Let them in.

436
23:47.425 --> 23:48.345
Yes.

437
24:03.825 --> 24:06.665
Lady Li summons Old Madam Wei and Noble Lady Wu'an.

438
24:13.745 --> 24:16.905
Rao, come inside with me.

439
24:49.545 --> 24:54.545
DWELLING IN TRUTH, DEEP IN THE WOODS

440
24:56.825 --> 24:57.825
No need for formalities.

441
24:58.945 --> 25:01.345
Old Madam Wei, have a seat.

442
25:09.545 --> 25:11.185
Your timing is perfect, Noble Lady Wu'an.

443
25:11.905 --> 25:13.385
Even if you hadn't come today,

444
25:13.465 --> 25:15.705
I would've sent for you.

445
25:16.865 --> 25:20.625
I trust you haven't forgotten my warning.

446
25:20.705 --> 25:24.185
-Lady Li… -Whatever you wish to reprimand her for,

447
25:24.785 --> 25:28.705
wait until you've seen the evidence she brought.

448
25:29.585 --> 25:31.265
Tell Lady Li

449
25:31.345 --> 25:34.545
exactly what you told me.

450
25:38.585 --> 25:41.065
Lady Li, A-Chou…

451
25:41.145 --> 25:43.225
No, Noble Lady Wu'an

452
25:43.745 --> 25:44.985
is not my biological daughter.

453
25:45.585 --> 25:47.145
Sixteen years ago,

454
25:47.225 --> 25:50.025
I found her under an old cypress tree on the rear hill.

455
25:50.545 --> 25:51.585
My eldest daughter died young,

456
25:51.665 --> 25:53.305
so I took the risk

457
25:53.385 --> 25:55.265
of giving this child A-Chou's identity

458
25:55.345 --> 25:57.305
and raised her as my own poor daughter.

459
25:57.945 --> 26:00.145
I selfishly hid the truth from her.

460
26:00.745 --> 26:02.025
I deserve death for my crime.

461
26:03.025 --> 26:04.025
Please have mercy, Lady Li.

462
26:10.305 --> 26:12.105
You found her on the mountain?

463
26:12.905 --> 26:15.465
Yes. I found her there.

464
26:16.065 --> 26:17.345
On the night of the Lantern Festival,

465
26:17.425 --> 26:20.305
Wei Rao was abducted and vanished without a trace.

466
26:21.465 --> 26:22.945
Someone clearly plotted to harm her

467
26:23.585 --> 26:25.825
and wanted her dead. Lv Lun.

468
26:28.105 --> 26:30.705
Lady Li, my wife, Madam Chang,

469
26:30.785 --> 26:32.545
served at the Wei Residence for years.

470
26:32.625 --> 26:35.385
She knew everything that happened there.

471
26:35.465 --> 26:38.425
One day, she happened to see her. It was her!

472
26:39.185 --> 26:40.705
She bribed the wet nurse and guards

473
26:40.785 --> 26:43.305
and conspired with criminals to kidnap and sell the young lady.

474
26:43.385 --> 26:45.945
Afterward, fearing she'd be executed,

475
26:46.025 --> 26:48.665
she cruelly abandoned the young lady in the wilderness

476
26:48.745 --> 26:50.865
and left her to die!

477
26:51.385 --> 26:52.945
The night the young lady disappeared,

478
26:53.025 --> 26:55.345
-she was wearing crimson… -You don't need to tell me that.

479
26:55.425 --> 26:58.505
The night Wei Rao disappeared, the court posted notices everywhere.

480
26:58.585 --> 27:00.265
Everyone knew what she was wearing.

481
27:00.865 --> 27:02.825
A crimson brocade robe with cloud patterns

482
27:02.905 --> 27:05.225
under a white fox cloak.

483
27:05.305 --> 27:07.025
What? Did you find them?

484
27:07.625 --> 27:08.505
Of course.

485
27:09.745 --> 27:12.065
My adoptive mother hid them under the stove for years.

486
27:12.145 --> 27:13.785
We only just found them.

487
27:15.065 --> 27:16.025
Bitao.

488
27:21.705 --> 27:23.225
Here's the evidence.

489
27:23.305 --> 27:24.465
One look and you'll know, Lady Li.

490
27:34.345 --> 27:35.545
Yinggu.

491
28:42.145 --> 28:43.825
LONG LIFE, ENDLESS BLESSINGS

492
29:04.465 --> 29:06.265
-This one's pretty. -Pretty, isn't it?

493
29:06.345 --> 29:08.705
LONG LIFE, ENDLESS BLESSINGS

494
29:12.105 --> 29:13.785
All you know is the gift for your daughter.

495
29:16.185 --> 29:17.025
Here.

496
29:21.345 --> 29:22.905
Here. I'll put it on you.

497
29:44.585 --> 29:47.105
Mother… I…

498
30:11.385 --> 30:13.865
That's right. Back then, Wei Jin

499
30:14.745 --> 30:17.265
personally engraved the Longevity Lock

500
30:17.945 --> 30:21.305
with "Long Life" and "Endless Blessings."

501
30:22.145 --> 30:23.945
But when Rao was born,

502
30:25.505 --> 30:27.705
I named her Mingzhu.

503
30:28.625 --> 30:30.545
My precious girl,

504
30:30.625 --> 30:32.505
cherished like a pearl in my palm.

505
30:33.305 --> 30:35.665
But fearing it would diminish her blessings,

506
30:36.185 --> 30:37.505
I only dared to engrave tiny words

507
30:37.585 --> 30:40.025
on the back of the Longevity Lock…

508
30:40.825 --> 30:43.745
"To my beloved daughter, Mingzhu."

509
30:44.425 --> 30:48.145
Those tiny words were never recorded in the case files,

510
30:48.225 --> 30:50.145
and very few people knew about them.

511
30:52.465 --> 30:54.585
But on the back of this Longevity Lock,

512
30:55.625 --> 30:57.105
there's nothing at all.

513
31:13.505 --> 31:14.545
How…

514
31:15.545 --> 31:16.625
How can that be?

515
31:21.825 --> 31:23.625
When I found Noble Lady Wu'an,

516
31:23.705 --> 31:25.585
she was wearing this very Longevity Lock.

517
31:26.225 --> 31:27.945
I knew it was tied to her true identity.

518
31:28.625 --> 31:30.785
I feared someone would discover it and take my child away.

519
31:31.785 --> 31:33.945
We were poor, but I never dared sell it.

520
31:34.585 --> 31:35.785
This is the one.

521
31:38.145 --> 31:42.545
Lady Li, could there be some mistake?

522
31:43.265 --> 31:44.145
Mother,

523
31:44.225 --> 31:48.065
you raised Rao yourself from the time she was little.

524
31:48.145 --> 31:50.345
There was never any doubt about who she was.

525
31:50.945 --> 31:53.505
Now someone else has come to claim her,

526
31:53.585 --> 31:56.745
so the keepsake must match perfectly

527
31:56.825 --> 31:58.585
before anyone can believe it.

528
31:58.665 --> 32:01.505
Please stay calm.

529
32:02.305 --> 32:03.625
Let Lady Li

530
32:04.785 --> 32:06.185
question them carefully.

531
32:07.385 --> 32:08.345
Lv Lun.

532
32:09.465 --> 32:11.585
Where is your wife, Madam Chang?

533
32:11.665 --> 32:12.585
She's dead.

534
32:13.185 --> 32:14.905
She was murdered!

535
32:14.985 --> 32:16.505
Wei Heng'e.

536
32:17.585 --> 32:19.065
Did you murder Madam Chang?

537
32:21.065 --> 32:22.745
I've been framed, Lady Li!

538
32:22.825 --> 32:25.825
That woman stole valuables and fled the residence.

539
32:25.905 --> 32:28.425
She fell off a cliff. She got what she deserved.

540
32:29.625 --> 32:31.185
Rao is my own niece.

541
32:31.785 --> 32:33.865
I'm married, and I can't inherit my brother's family's wealth anyway.

542
32:33.945 --> 32:36.945
The claim that I'd harm Wei Rao makes no sense at all.

543
32:37.985 --> 32:40.065
This man is treacherous and greedy.

544
32:40.145 --> 32:42.745
He and his wife were partners in crime.

545
32:42.825 --> 32:45.665
Now he's helping outsiders falsely accuse his own masters!

546
32:45.745 --> 32:47.665
What could he possibly be after?

547
32:48.665 --> 32:51.305
Lady Li, please see the truth!

548
32:51.905 --> 32:54.385
Give him 40 lashes, then question him again!

549
32:55.025 --> 32:57.105
-Guards! -Mercy, Lady Li! Please!

550
32:57.185 --> 32:59.025
Everything I said is true!

551
32:59.105 --> 33:02.225
I-I wouldn't dare lie! Mercy, Lady Li! Mercy!

552
33:02.305 --> 33:03.625
-You can't beat a confession out of him! -Mercy please!

553
33:03.705 --> 33:05.225
You don't get to speak.

554
33:14.385 --> 33:17.025
I'll confess!

555
33:17.545 --> 33:18.785
I'll tell you everything!

556
33:22.465 --> 33:23.745
Lady Li,

557
33:24.265 --> 33:25.945
I lied.

558
33:26.025 --> 33:27.465
The truth is,

559
33:27.545 --> 33:30.185
I was acting on Noble Lady Wu'an's orders!

560
33:46.585 --> 33:48.145
Hurry! Faster!

561
33:48.865 --> 33:50.905
Mother, what message did His Lordship send

562
33:50.985 --> 33:53.065
that has you rushing to Xianzhuang like this?

563
33:53.905 --> 33:55.905
Why not bring Sister with us?

564
33:56.625 --> 33:58.425
Does this concern Noble Lady Wu'an?

565
33:58.505 --> 34:01.505
She can't handle serious matters. She'd only make things worse.

566
34:02.185 --> 34:03.185
You're levelheaded.

567
34:03.265 --> 34:06.505
Don't ask questions now. You'll know when we get there.

568
34:09.145 --> 34:09.985
You there!

569
34:12.865 --> 34:14.145
What's going on?

570
34:14.225 --> 34:15.665
Madam, two carriages collided at the city gate.

571
34:15.744 --> 34:17.145
Neither side will back down,

572
34:17.225 --> 34:18.264
so they've blocked the gate.

573
34:18.344 --> 34:19.625
Take another route. Now!

574
34:19.705 --> 34:22.065
Going around the west side will be a long detour.

575
34:22.145 --> 34:24.185
We may not reach the estate until the Xu hour.

576
34:24.824 --> 34:27.505
This is bad. Very bad.

577
34:28.344 --> 34:30.225
Make way for the Duke's carriage!

578
34:33.945 --> 34:35.865
Take the detour! Hurry!

579
34:38.025 --> 34:38.945
She…

580
34:39.025 --> 34:40.744
She gave me 200 coins

581
34:40.824 --> 34:43.985
and told me to make up lies to frame Lady Heng'e!

582
34:44.065 --> 34:46.545
That story about bribing the wet nurse and swapping the girl

583
34:46.625 --> 34:48.105
was all made up by this fraud.

584
34:48.185 --> 34:50.264
She even fabricated evidence to deceive everyone!

585
34:50.344 --> 34:53.824
See? She even found an identical Longevity Lock.

586
34:53.905 --> 34:55.625
I didn't dare do it at first.

587
34:55.705 --> 34:58.025
But she kept tempting me.

588
34:58.985 --> 35:01.865
She knew she looked just like Lady Wei Rao,

589
35:01.945 --> 35:04.265
so she boldly hatched this scheme to turn you against each other!

590
35:05.025 --> 35:08.345
After all, my wife is already dead,

591
35:08.425 --> 35:10.945
and the wet nurse and guards are dead, leaving no witnesses.

592
35:11.025 --> 35:13.025
With truth and lies all mixed up, she could easily manipulate things.

593
35:13.665 --> 35:15.505
If you believed even part of her story,

594
35:15.585 --> 35:17.265
she could make the rest look true

595
35:17.345 --> 35:19.265
and claim the title of Noble Lady,

596
35:19.345 --> 35:21.905
living in wealth and luxury forever!

597
35:21.985 --> 35:23.905
She even promised me a mansion and fertile land,

598
35:23.985 --> 35:25.705
plus a beautiful new wife.

599
35:25.785 --> 35:28.705
I lost my head for a moment. Greed blinded me.

600
35:28.785 --> 35:31.145
I deserve death!

601
35:31.225 --> 35:33.305
-You lying snake! -I deserve death!

602
35:33.385 --> 35:35.945
You claimed to be a Wei servant seeking my protection,

603
35:36.545 --> 35:37.665
but someone had already bought you off!

604
35:37.745 --> 35:39.025
You set this trap to frame me!

605
35:39.705 --> 35:40.665
If this Longevity Lock is fake,

606
35:40.745 --> 35:42.985
then the clothes, shoes, and socks must be fake too?

607
35:43.065 --> 35:45.545
I was only a child. What could I possibly have known

608
35:45.625 --> 35:46.985
about the personal belongings

609
35:47.065 --> 35:49.225
of a noble girl from the Earl's household years ago?

610
35:49.305 --> 35:50.745
Even if they're all fake,

611
35:51.385 --> 35:53.305
why were the fleeing wet nurse and guards

612
35:53.385 --> 35:54.825
killed at South Mountain of all places?

613
35:55.585 --> 35:57.825
If that wasn't silencing witnesses, what was it?

614
35:57.905 --> 36:00.185
How dare you tell such a shameless lie?

615
36:00.265 --> 36:02.225
Aren't you afraid of divine punishment?

616
36:02.305 --> 36:05.585
Lady Li, I have proof of what I said.

617
36:05.665 --> 36:09.345
I didn't spend a single coin of the bribe she gave me.

618
36:09.425 --> 36:12.865
I buried it all outside the city, under the old elm tree on Jiwei Slope.

619
36:12.945 --> 36:15.385
If you don't believe me, send someone to dig it up.

620
36:20.905 --> 36:21.905
Guards.

621
36:22.945 --> 36:24.105
Take him to retrieve the evidence.

622
36:27.465 --> 36:28.425
Move!

623
36:29.625 --> 36:31.545
Lady Li, when the evidence was found,

624
36:32.145 --> 36:33.465
Lord Lu saw it himself.

625
36:33.545 --> 36:36.145
-He can testify for me. -Lord Lu?

626
36:37.385 --> 36:40.225
You've bewitched Lord Lu so completely he can't tell right from wrong.

627
36:40.305 --> 36:41.905
And you expect him to judge the truth?

628
36:43.065 --> 36:46.065
Child traffickers would never leave evidence behind.

629
36:46.145 --> 36:48.545
They'd have burned or buried it long ago.

630
36:50.745 --> 36:53.665
These are all fake!

631
36:54.265 --> 36:56.665
Fake! Every last one is fake!

632
37:04.745 --> 37:07.105
The substitute bride I found back then

633
37:07.745 --> 37:10.385
was so greedy

634
37:10.465 --> 37:14.425
she spun an outrageous lie to take Rao's place!

635
37:15.305 --> 37:18.385
It's my fault. As her aunt,

636
37:18.985 --> 37:21.985
I let a wolf into our home and harmed Rao!

637
37:22.545 --> 37:23.385
Lady Li,

638
37:24.025 --> 37:25.185
this mother and daughter

639
37:25.265 --> 37:28.385
conspired in secret to impersonate a noblewoman.

640
37:29.305 --> 37:31.425
They must not be spared!

641
37:31.505 --> 37:33.705
No! I swear we didn't!

642
37:33.785 --> 37:35.905
I truly picked up Noble Lady Wu'an.

643
37:35.985 --> 37:37.185
I wouldn't dare lie.

644
37:39.425 --> 37:41.465
Rao isn't your biological daughter.

645
37:42.825 --> 37:45.745
Yet you're so eager to condemn me.

646
37:46.745 --> 37:48.105
What are you really after?

647
37:49.065 --> 37:50.585
What am I after?

648
37:50.665 --> 37:52.465
What could I possibly want?

649
37:52.545 --> 37:54.545
I only feel sorry for the poor child

650
37:54.625 --> 37:56.425
that my late brother left behind.

651
37:58.225 --> 37:59.665
Yes, pitiful indeed.

652
38:02.105 --> 38:04.145
My birth father died in battle

653
38:04.225 --> 38:07.065
and entrusted his young daughter to his own family,

654
38:08.985 --> 38:10.025
hoping you

655
38:10.625 --> 38:12.905
would raise and cherish his precious girl.

656
38:12.985 --> 38:15.505
How could he know his own sister

657
38:15.585 --> 38:18.345
would swap two girls for her own selfish gain?

658
38:18.905 --> 38:22.305
One grew up pampered in luxury,

659
38:22.825 --> 38:25.265
while the other lived in poverty, driven to the brink!

660
38:27.145 --> 38:30.225
Wei Heng'e, ask yourself.

661
38:30.865 --> 38:31.825
After everything you've done,

662
38:31.905 --> 38:34.145
can you face the brother who died in battle?

663
38:34.225 --> 38:36.745
-Can you face your own conscience? -Shut your mouth!

664
38:37.345 --> 38:38.625
My conscience is clear!

665
38:38.705 --> 38:42.185
I did nothing! I can swear to Heaven!

666
38:42.265 --> 38:43.385
What would I have to fear?

667
38:53.185 --> 38:54.025
Bitao.

668
38:55.625 --> 38:58.225
You grew up in our Wei family.

669
38:58.305 --> 39:00.865
You were always by Lady Wei Rao's side.

670
39:00.945 --> 39:02.905
She cared for you more than anyone.

671
39:04.025 --> 39:07.345
How could you forget all the Wei family did for you

672
39:07.425 --> 39:08.865
and help someone commit such evil?

673
39:08.945 --> 39:10.745
How could you serve an impostor?

674
39:11.665 --> 39:12.625
Bitao.

675
39:12.705 --> 39:16.025
Tell us. What do you know?

676
39:41.705 --> 39:43.025
It was you.

677
39:46.825 --> 39:49.065
You switched the Longevity Lock.

678
39:50.865 --> 39:52.065
Your Ladyship…

679
39:52.825 --> 39:53.905
I…

680
39:54.945 --> 39:55.785
I…

681
39:58.145 --> 40:00.865
Keep stalling, and you'll anger Lady Li.

682
40:00.945 --> 40:02.985
Then you'll be dragged out and beaten to death!

683
40:03.065 --> 40:05.545
Your parents and brothers will be punished too!

684
40:08.145 --> 40:09.785
You'd better tell the truth.

685
40:10.385 --> 40:13.225
Don't be afraid. As long as you tell the truth,

686
40:13.825 --> 40:17.625
Lady Li will see that justice is done.

687
40:17.705 --> 40:19.785
Speak! Have you lost your voice?

688
40:20.305 --> 40:21.265
I said, speak!

689
40:45.465 --> 40:46.985
So that's how it is.

690
40:49.825 --> 40:52.465
From the very first day I entered the Wei Residence,

691
40:53.825 --> 40:56.665
someone had already planted a pawn by my side,

692
40:58.225 --> 41:00.265
waiting for this very day.

693
41:02.625 --> 41:05.905
I was too foolish, too naive,

694
41:07.305 --> 41:09.745
too desperate to find my birth mother

695
41:11.705 --> 41:13.945
to see the trap right in front of me.

696
41:21.905 --> 41:23.185
Wei Heng'e.

697
41:27.465 --> 41:29.145
When I disappeared back then,

698
41:29.705 --> 41:32.585
you must have had help inside the residence to switch us!

699
41:34.825 --> 41:37.345
-Who could that have been? -You…

700
41:40.385 --> 41:42.985
You certainly have a sharp tongue.

701
41:43.785 --> 41:45.025
You turn defense into attack

702
41:45.705 --> 41:47.825
and keep pressing your accusations.

703
41:47.905 --> 41:49.545
You have no proof,

704
41:49.625 --> 41:53.385
yet you twist the truth and falsely accuse others.

705
41:54.545 --> 41:58.265
You're still young. Stay on the right path.

706
41:58.785 --> 42:02.665
Don't make a foolish choice you'll regret.

707
42:03.905 --> 42:05.745
A Longevity Lock can be forged.

708
42:06.665 --> 42:07.865
Witnesses can be bought.

709
42:11.385 --> 42:12.825
It's been 16 years.

710
42:14.105 --> 42:15.905
Someone has deliberately interfered,

711
42:15.985 --> 42:17.825
trying to turn truth into lies

712
42:17.905 --> 42:19.785
and keep a mother and daughter apart.

713
42:20.345 --> 42:21.745
But I want to ask you,

714
42:23.585 --> 42:24.785
Lady Li.

715
42:27.585 --> 42:29.905
Why did you lose your own daughter?

716
42:30.665 --> 42:32.025
And why,

717
42:32.105 --> 42:35.225
when she's standing right in front of you, do you refuse to see the truth

718
42:35.305 --> 42:38.025
and let them make up lies to slander her?

719
42:45.305 --> 42:46.385
Why?

720
42:56.745 --> 42:57.905
Mother!

721
43:14.705 --> 43:17.705
Mother, you're confused. How can you believe a fraud?

722
43:17.785 --> 43:21.465
She uses sweet words to twist right and wrong.

723
43:22.065 --> 43:25.185
You'll believe her, but not your own daughter?

724
43:26.505 --> 43:28.425
Mother, look at me.

725
43:30.065 --> 43:31.425
Feel this.

726
43:33.465 --> 43:35.425
When you left the Wei family back then,

727
43:35.505 --> 43:38.105
Grandmother was grieving Father's early death.

728
43:38.185 --> 43:39.665
No one in the family had time for me.

729
43:40.265 --> 43:43.225
I secretly slipped out, hoping to find you at the palace.

730
43:43.825 --> 43:45.665
But the steps were too high.

731
43:45.745 --> 43:48.065
I slipped and fell. That's how I got this scar.

732
43:49.665 --> 43:52.345
This scar proves how much I missed you, Mother.

733
43:55.265 --> 43:56.305
Mother.

734
43:57.985 --> 43:59.905
Mother, are you really going to believe her

735
43:59.985 --> 44:01.585
and abandon your own daughter?

736
44:03.225 --> 44:04.585
Does it still hurt?

737
44:42.225 --> 44:45.785
How did the world come to this?

738
44:46.545 --> 44:49.585
What is real anymore? What is false?

739
44:49.665 --> 44:50.665
I…

740
44:52.265 --> 44:53.345
Mother.

741
44:53.985 --> 44:57.945
We should leave this matter to Lady Li.

742
44:58.025 --> 45:00.465
As long as Lady Li acts decisively

743
45:00.545 --> 45:01.785
and puts an end to this,

744
45:01.865 --> 45:04.865
the Lu family will know it's settled

745
45:04.945 --> 45:06.625
and won't dare object.

746
45:06.705 --> 45:09.225
No matter how bold Lu Zhuo is,

747
45:09.305 --> 45:13.145
the family is still ruled by the upright old Duke.

748
45:13.745 --> 45:15.305
Once it's done,

749
45:15.385 --> 45:17.505
the two families can settle the rest.

750
45:18.105 --> 45:19.825
Then everything can be covered up,

751
45:20.425 --> 45:22.705
without involving the Wei family.

752
45:23.545 --> 45:25.225
You can finally rest easy.

753
45:25.305 --> 45:26.705
And we can

754
45:27.865 --> 45:32.585
give Lady Rao's late father an answer.

755
45:32.665 --> 45:36.625
My only fear is that Lady Li will hesitate

756
45:36.705 --> 45:39.425
and go soft.

757
45:45.705 --> 45:46.785
Mother.

758
45:47.385 --> 45:49.945
The evidence is conclusive now. She has no defense left!

759
45:50.705 --> 45:52.305
Will you still indulge this liar

760
45:52.385 --> 45:55.505
and let her humiliate me in public and disgrace Father's name?

761
45:56.105 --> 45:57.945
Mother, make your decision!

762
46:05.065 --> 46:06.025
A-Chou.

763
46:07.465 --> 46:08.825
What else do you have to say?

764
46:09.985 --> 46:11.305
I have nothing to say.

765
46:14.225 --> 46:16.585
Guards! Take her…

766
46:20.385 --> 46:21.345
Stop!

767
48:32.345 --> 48:34.585
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED ‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
